> Outstanding natural conditions, a mountain sports offering that is unequ[alled] and an excellent tourist infrastructure, together with cordial hospitality, outstanding cuisine and an inspiring combination of tradition and[ modern]ity[ - these] are[ the] ingredients that[ make] Lech Zürs am[ Arl]berg[ one of] the leading holiday resorts in the Alpine region. "More time, more space" in a breathtakingly diverse[ landscape].
